{
  "dom_id": "step-615570",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving a Problem Involving a Ratio of Mixed Numbers",
  "problem": "A printer produces $2\\,\\dfrac{1}{2}$ pages in $1\\,\\dfrac{1}{4}$ minutes at a constant rate. How many pages will it produce in $4$ minutes at the same rate?",
  "worked_solution": "To find the number of pages the printer will produce in $4$ minutes, we first find the unit rate of pages per minute, and then multiply that unit rate by $4$ minutes.\n\nTo find the unit rate of pages per minute, we divide the number of pages, $2\\,\\dfrac{1}{2},$ by the number of minutes, $1\\,\\dfrac{1}{4},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n2\\,\\dfrac{1}{2} \\div 1\\,\\dfrac{1}{4}\n$$\n\nFirst, we write each mixed number as an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\,\\frac{1}{2} & =\\frac{(2\\times 2)+1}{2}=\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 1\\,\\frac{1}{4} & =\\frac{(1\\times 4)+1}{4}=\\frac{5}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our problem now is to compute:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5}{2} \\div \\dfrac{5}{4}\n$$\n\nDividing one fraction by another is equivalent to multiplying by the reciprocal:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{2}÷\\frac{5}{4} & =\\frac{5}{2}\\times \\frac{4}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{5}\\times 4}{2\\times \\cancel{5}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{2} \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the unit rate is $2$ pages per minute.\n\nNow, we multiply this unit rate by $4$ minutes:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\times 4 & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the printer will produce $8$ pages in $4$ minutes.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-615570\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"615570\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"22092\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-615570\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-8\">Solving a Problem Involving a Ratio of Mixed Numbers</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"615570\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>A printer produces <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"3.548ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 1527.7 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">2\\,\\dfrac{1}{2}</title>\n<defs aria